con2dpm13.out
Test of 2D plane stress CDPM2 - Step 0 elastic scaffold (single CST triangle, imposed uniform strain)
StaticStructural nsteps 1 initialguess 1 rtolf 1.e-6 stiffMode 2 maxiter 100 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dPlaneStress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 3 nelem 1 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 2 nltf 1 nic 0 nset 0
node 1 coords 3 0.0 0.0 0.0 bc 2 1 1
node 2 coords 3 1.0 0.0 0.0 bc 2 2 1
node 3 coords 3 0.0 1.0 0.0 bc 2 1 1
trplanestress2d 1 nodes 3 1 2 3 mat 1 crossSect 1
SimpleCS 1 thick 1.0
con2dpm 1 d 0 E 20.e9 n 0.2 talpha 0. wf 800.e-6 fc 35e6 ft 2.e6 hp 0.025 yieldtol 1.e-10 asoft 7. stype 2 damflag 3
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 prescribedvalue 0.0
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 prescribedvalue 5.e-5
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e1
## imposed uniform strain exx=5e-5, eyy=0, gxy=0 on a CST triangle.
## plane-stress elastic: sxx = E/(1-n^2)*exx, syy = n*E/(1-n^2)*exx.
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 4 component 1 value 5.00000000e-05 tolerance 1.e-9
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 1 value 1.04166667e+06
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 2 value 2.08333333e+05
#%END_CHECK%
